cl. 6. P. विलति, to cover, conceal, clothe, Dhātup. xxviii, 66;
 cl. 10. P. वेलयति, to throw, cast, send, ib. xxxii, 65 (cf. √ पिल्);
to break or divide (cf. √ बिल्).

वि-√ लङ्घ् P. Ā. -लङ्घति, ˚ते (aor. व्य्-अलघिषुः, Śiś. xvii, 55), to leap, jump, rise up to (acc.), Śiś.; BhP. :
Caus. -लङ्घयति, to leap or jump over, cross, pass (time), traverse (a distance), overstep (bounds), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to transgress, contemn, neglect, violate (commands &c.), Kāv.; Kathās.;
to rise up, ascend to (acc.), MBh.; Kir.;
to rise beyond, overcome, subdue, Kāv.; Kathās.;
to excel, surpass, Kāvyād.;
to pass over, set aside, abandon, Ragh.; Kathās.;
to act wrongly towards, offend, Śiś.;
to cause to pass over (the right time for eating), cause to fast, Suśr.,

वि-√ लप् P. -लपति (rarely Ā. inf. -लपितुम्, or -लप्तुम् pr.p. -लप्यत्, MBh. vii, 2681), to utter moaning sounds, wail, lament, bewail (acc. with or without प्रति), AV. &c. &c.;
to speak variously, talk, chatter, MBh.; Hariv. :
Caus. -लापयति, ˚ते, to cause to mourn or lament, AV. (cf. Pāṇ. i, 4, 52,

 Sch.);
to cause to speak much (Ā.), Bhaṭṭ. :
Intens. (only p. -ला॑लपत्), to talk idly, MaitrS.

वि-√ लभ् Ā. -लभते, to part asunder, separate, KātyŚr.;
to take away, remove (dung from a stable), Kṛṣis.;
to procure, bestow, grant, consign, hand over, deliver up, Inscr.; Kathās.; Rājat. &c.;
to choose, elect, HPariś. :
Caus. -लम्भयति, to cause to receive or fall to the share of (two acc.), Kathās. :
Desid. -लिप्सते, to desire to divide or distribute, ŚBr.

वि-√ लम्ब् Ā. -लम्बते (rarely P.), to hang on both sides to (acc.), PañcavBr.;
to hang down, hang on, be attached to (loc.), MBh.; R. &c.;
to sink, set, decline, MBh.;
to continue hanging, linger, delay, tarry, hesitate (‘with’ or ‘to’, प्रति), Gaut.; MBh. &c.:
Caus. लम्बयति, to hang on (loc.), Pañcat. ii, 62/63 (read -लम्ब्य with B.);
to cause to linger or loiter, detain, delay, Kathās.;
to spend (time) unprofitably, waste, lose, Hariv.;
to put off, procrastinate, Yājñ.; R.; Pañcat.

वि-√ लस् P. -लसति, to gleam, flash, glitter (only pr. p. -लसत्, q.v., and pf. -ललास, Bhaṭṭ.);
to shine forth, appear, arise, become visible, Śiś.;
to sound forth, echo (see वि-लसन्);
to play, sport, dally, be amused or delighted, Kāv.; Kathās.;
to vibrate, coruscate (see वि-लसत्) :
Caus. -लासयति, to cause to dance, Vās.

वि-√ लिख् P. -लिखति (Ved. inf. -लिखस्; cf. Pāṇ. iii, 4, 13, Sch.),
to scratch, scrape, tear up, lacerate, Lāṭy.; MBh. &c.;
to rub against, reach to, touch, Hariv.;
to wound (the heart) i.e. vex, offend, ŚBr.;
to scratch in or on, make a furrow or mark, write, delineate, paint, Gol.; MBh. &c.;
 (in medicine) to tear up i.e. stir up (phlegm &c.), Car. :
Caus. -लेखयति, or -लिखापयति, to cause to scratch or write, Kṛṣṇaj.

वि-√ लिप् P. Ā. -लिम्पति, ˚ते, to smear or spread over, anoint (also ‘to anoint one's self’ P.), ŚBr. &c. &c.;
to smear or spread with (instr.), Kum. :
Caus. -लेपयति, to smear or anoint with (instr.), Hcat.;
 -लिम्पयति See -लिम्पित.

वि-√ ली Ā. -लीयते (pf. -लिल्युह्, MBh.; fut. -लेता, or -लाता; ind.p. -लीय or -लाय, Pāṇ. vi, 1, 51, Sch.),
to cling or cleave or adhere to, MBh.; Ratnāv.; Śiś.;
to hide or conceal one's self, disappear, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to be dissolved, melt, AV. &c. &c.:
Caus. -लापयति or -लाययति or -लालयति or -लीनयति (Pāṇ. vii, 3, 39, Sch.), to cause to disappear, destroy, Śaṃk.;
to cause to be dissolved or absorbed in (loc.), BhP., Sch.;
to make liquid, dissolve, melt, Suśr.

वि-√ लुड् (cf. prec. and वि-लुलित), Caus. -लोडयति, to stir about, stir up, mingle, Suśr.; Hcat.;
to move to and fro, toss about, upset, disorder, confuse, MBh.; Hariv.;
to betake one's self into (acc.), Naiṣ., Sch.

वि-√ लुप् P. -लुम्पति (rarely Ā.), to tear or break off or to pieces, wound, lacerate, pull out or up, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to tear away, carry off, ravish, seize, rob, plunder, AitBr. &c. &c.;
to destroy, confound, ruin, MBh.; R. &c.;
 (Ā.) to fall to pieces, be ruined, disappear, Kauś.; ChUp. :
Pass. -लुप्यते, to be torn away or carried off, be impaired or destroyed, perish, be lost, disappear, fail, AitBr. &c. &c.:
Caus. -लोपयति (˚ते), to tear or carry away, withhold, keep back, suppress, extinguish, destroy, MBh.; Kām.; MārkP.

वि-√ लुभ् Caus. -लोभयति, to lead astray, perplex, confuse, Daśar.;
to allure, entice, tempt, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to divert, amuse, delight, R.; Śak. (v.l.)

वि-√ लोक् (only inf. -लोकितुम् and ind.p. -लोक्य), to look at or upon, regard, examine, test, study, MBh.; Kāv. &c.:
Caus. -लोकयति, to look at, consider, observe, regard, examine, try, inspect, Gobh.; MBh. &c.;
to be able to see, possess the faculty of seeing, Bhartṛ. (v.l.);
to have regard to (acc.), Prab.;
to look over or beyond (acc.), Mn. viii, 239 :
Pass. -लोक्यते (aor. व्य्-अलोकि), to be seen, be visible, Kathās.; BhP.
